# at HEAD f8dca1fda / TREE 6f2e01b56; live specimen §3 deferred behind the
# IMPLEMENTATION01 predecessor. The epic ledger at
# .factory/epics/approval-protection.md row 19 binds to the ACT file AND to
# the evidence file .factory/evidence/ACT-CLINEMM-EDITOR-TOOL-APPROVAL-FRICTION-RECON01/source-seam-map.md,
# so both must be durably tracked for the canonical link to survive a
# fresh clone.
!/.factory/acts/ACT-CLINEMM-EDITOR-TOOL-APPROVAL-FRICTION-RECON01.md
# ACT-CLINEMM-APPROVAL-SPECIMEN-CAPTURE-TOOL01-CORRECTION01: bounded
# correction ACT authored 2026-08-27 against the editor-tool recon
# ACT's evidence-acquisition toolchain (capture-approval-specimen.py).
# Status OPEN / HIGH. The correction ACT binds to the editor-tool
# recon ACT (which it corrects) and to the binding record
# .factory/evidence/ACT-CLINEMM-EDITOR-TOOL-APPROVAL-FRICTION-RECON01/captures/specimen-20260827-command-approval01.json,
# so the ACT file AND the captures/ binding record must both be
# durably tracked for the canonical link to survive a fresh clone.
!/.factory/acts/ACT-CLINEMM-APPROVAL-SPECIMEN-CAPTURE-TOOL01-CORRECTION01.md
# Same durable-binding reason as the ACT file above.
# Mirror the .factory/acts/ default-deny + whitelist pattern:
#   1. re-include the .factory/evidence/ directory so git can recurse,
#   2. deny everything under it by default,
#   3. whitelist the directory contents that have a durable-binding
#      contract with an epic ledger / ACT file.
!/.factory/evidence/
/.factory/evidence/*
!/.factory/evidence/ACT-CLINEMM-EDITOR-TOOL-APPROVAL-FRICTION-RECON01/
# ACT-CLINEMM-APPROVAL-SPECIMEN-CAPTURE-TOOL01-CORRECTION01 evidence
